{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-e1302ec9235947370278","statement":"(1) Let ${\\bA}$ be a complete local algebra over $\\Mk$. Then $\\bA $ is gentle if and only if $\\bA$ is isomorphic to one of the following algebras:\n\n- $\\bL_1= \\Mk.$\n\n- $\\bL_2=\\Mk[x]/(x^{2}).$\n\n- $\\bL_3=\\Mk [[x]]$.\n\n- $\\bL_4=\\Mk [[x,y]]/(xy)$.\n\n- $\\bL_5=\\Mk \\left<\\left< x,y\\right>\\right> /(x^{2}, y^{2})$.\n\n(2) Let $\\Mk\\kQ/\\kI$ be a two-point algebra over $\\Mk$ and $\\bA$ its completion. Then the following conditions are equivalent:\n\n- $\\bA$ is gentle.\n\n- $\\bA$ is isomorphic to one of the algebras from Table <<ref:table_gentle>> below.","source_id":"arXiv:0812.4783","cluster":"representation_theory","statement_sha256":"82a50339f10456d9f091a9b7ff1de81dfd3afb9378f695effde97d0fb0b09d8d","kind":"proposition","label":"Proposition 7","ref_key":"gentle","name":"","order":10,"deps":[{"ref":"table_gentle","card_id":null,"label":null,"resolved":false,"target":"statement"}],"cite_keys":[],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/0812.4783","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"4691b7e6310aff594015f4ee9295f0c5d77eb87af5ba0a297bb3f4cdbb2ee258","line":512,"origin":"latex_env","retrieved_at":"2026-09-29T14:02:07+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v3","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":537,"math_hints":61}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:0812.4783","title":"Derived tame local and two-point algebras","abstract":"We determine derived representation type of complete finitely generated local and two-point algebras over an algebraically closed field.","authors":["Viktor Bekkert","Yuriy Drozd","Vyacheslav Futorny"],"year":"2008","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/0812.4783","cluster":"representation_theory","macros":{"lenght":"\\mathop\\mathrm{lenght}\\nolimits","md":"#1\\mbox{-}\\mathrm{mod}","pr":"#1\\mbox{-}\\mathrm{pro}","bp":"\\bullet","iso":"\\simeq","iff":"if and